            "entityId": "bright",
            "field": "reported_message",
            "value": {
              "kind": "reported_message",
              "speakerId": "bright",
              "text": "寻常医馆若只是抓药看诊，前堂的学徒或伙计接了方子就能办。"
            },
            "certainty": "uncertain",
            "visibility": "private"
          },
          "dialogue.84ce040523c7049bfe86990805584b69d70ecfa893b79b7aefadb76c1c049461.d6bdce8c3df89fc42064161b1a2cd5485ce245dc8855323a9dff8c60a2d1d95b.message": {
            "effectiveAt": {
              "id": "legacy.story.order",
              "clock": "turn",
              "at": 12,
              "actorId": "legacy.story"
            },
            "discoveryConditions": [
              "actual-receipt"
            ],
            "dependencyRefs": [],
            "id": "dialogue.84ce040523c7049bfe86990805584b69d70ecfa893b79b7aefadb76c1c049461.d6bdce8c3df89fc42064161b1a2cd5485ce245dc8855323a9dff8c60a2d1d95b.message",
            "entityId": "bright",
            "field": "reported_message",
            "value": {
              "kind": "reported_message",
              "speakerId": "bright",
              "text": "不过村医写的是举荐你求医求学的信，这算熟人之间的托付。前堂的人多半不敢擅自拿主意，即便接了信，最后也得转交到馆主手里，由他亲自过目。"
            },
            "certainty": "uncertain",
            "visibility": "private"
          },
          "dialogue.84ce040523c7049bfe86990805584b69d70ecfa893b79b7aefadb76c1c049461.313b5e1b5e85f266f052a9981dae175809257449a1159b5a5c9e964e2124487d.message": {
            "effectiveAt": {
              "id": "legacy.story.order",
              "clock": "turn",
              "at": 12,
              "actorId": "legacy.story"
            },
            "discoveryConditions": [
              "actual-receipt"
            ],
            "dependencyRefs": [],
            "id": "dialogue.84ce040523c7049bfe86990805584b69d70ecfa893b79b7aefadb76c1c049461.313b5e1b5e85f266f052a9981dae175809257449a1159b5a5c9e964e2124487d.message",
            "entityId": "bright",
            "field": "reported_message",
            "value": {
              "kind": "reported_message",
              "speakerId": "bright",
              "text": "先递给门前接待的人引荐即可。馆主若是愿意见，自然会出来同你说话；若是有急诊在忙，也得看他们里头的安排。"
            },
            "certainty": "uncertain",
            "visibility": "private"
          }
        },
